{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for an initial conversation about focused, time-limited work or ongoing support." />
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0f1720;--muted:#9aa6b2;--accent:#8bd3c7;--accent-2:#7f6bff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);--text:#e6eef6}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#07121a);color:var(--text);}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:22px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#042;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,18,24,0.6)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--text)}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:24px;align-items:start;background:radial-gradient(600px 300px at 10% 10%,rgba(127,107,255,0.08),transparent),var(--glass);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .hero .intro{padding:8px 12px}
    h1{margin:6px 0 6px;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.2px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
    .pattern{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;display:block;border-radius:10px;padding:10px}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0}
    .mood{padding:10px 12px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:all .22s}
    .mood:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(8,10,12,0.5)}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,211,199,0.12),rgba(127,107,255,0.09));color:var(--text);border-color:rgba(127,107,255,0.12)}
    .recommended{margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .method-title{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0}
    .method-desc{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border-radius:999px;padding:6px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .price-card{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.015);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .price{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--text);outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .disclaimer{margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:860px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav a{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Licensed clinician</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Q&A</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <section class="intro">
        <h1>Connect — an invitation to choose the kind of support that feels most useful now</h1>
        <p class="lead">If you are considering short, concentrated work or steadier weekly sessions, use these tools to match a path to how you feel today. I aim to offer clear options and boundaries so you can decide with confidence.</p>

        <div class="mood-card">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Start with how you are feeling</div>
          <div class="moods" role="list" aria-label="Mood selector">
            <button class="mood" data-method="intensive" data-cta="Request an Intensive" type="button">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-method="short_focus" data-cta="Request a Short Focus" type="button">Stuck</button>
            <button class="mood" data-method="weekly" data-cta="Schedule Weekly" type="button">Wobbly / Unsteady</button>
            <button class="mood" data-method="transition" data-cta="Plan a Transition" type="button">Navigating Change</button>
            <button class="mood" data-method="maintenance" data-cta="Book a Check-in" type="button">Need a Check-in</button>
          </div>

          <div class="recommended" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="method-title" id="methodTitle">Choose how you feel</div>
            <div class="method-desc" id="methodDesc">Select a mood above to see a recommended approach and a suggested next step. Your choice will pre-fill the message when you reach out.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing" aria-hidden="false">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Pricing comparator</div>
            <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
              <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" type="button">Monthly</button>
              <button id="packageBtn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" type="button">Package</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="prices">
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="small">Renewal Sessions</div>
              <div class="price" id="priceOne">$0</div>
              <div class="small" id="priceOneSub">/session</div>
              <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">Regular weekly or biweekly therapy. Billed per session. Sliding scale available by conversation.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="small">Intensive Focus</div>
              <div class="price" id="priceTwo">$0</div>
              <div class="small" id="priceTwoSub">total</div>
              <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">A compact series (4–6 sessions) to address a specific concern with concentrated attention.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="pattern" aria-label="Contact and booking">
        <form id="contactForm" class="contact-form" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="get">
          <label for="name">Full name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" required />

          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="message">Brief note (what feels most urgent / helpful)</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="I am reaching out because..." ></textarea>

          <label for="methodSelect">If you selected a mood, it will appear here</label>
          <input id="methodSelect" name="recommended_method" readonly />

          <input type="hidden" name="source" value="contact-page" />

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px">
            <button id="primaryCta" class="cta" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div class="disclaimer">
            <strong>Confidentiality & scope:</strong> Sessions, messages, and records are kept confidential except where disclosure is required by law. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, call local emergency services or a crisis line right away. For administrative questions: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a>.
          </div>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
        <div style="color:var(--muted)">Licensed clinician in {{STATE}} • Serving {{CITY}}</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">No guarantees are made regarding outcomes. Services are supportive and therapeutic; they do not replace emergency care.</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      // Pricing comparator numbers
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
      const packageBtn = document.getElementById('packageBtn');
      const priceOneEl = document.getElementById('priceOne');
      const priceTwoEl = document.getElementById('priceTwo');
      const priceOneSub = document.getElementById('priceOneSub');
      const priceTwoSub = document.getElementById('priceTwoSub');

      // Two states: monthly and package. Values chosen to reflect different framing.
      const monthlyState = {one:120, oneSub:'/session', two:480, twoSub:'/month-plan'}; // Renewal Sessions $120/session; $480/month membership example
      const packageState = {one:140, oneSub:'/single', two:1200, twoSub:'total'}; // Single session higher, intensive package $1200 total

      let current = {one:0,two:0};
      let anim = null;

      function animateNumbers(target){
        cancelAnimationFrame(anim);
        const startOne = current.one; const startTwo = current.two;
        const dur = 450; const start = performance.now();
        function tick(now){
          const t = Math.min(1,(now-start)/dur);
          const ease = (--t)*t*t+1; // easeOutCubic
          current.one = Math.round(startOne + (target.one - startOne)*ease);
          current.two = Math.round(startTwo + (target.two - startTwo)*ease);
          priceOneEl.textContent = '$' + current.one;
          priceTwoEl.textContent = '$' + current.two;
          if(performance.now() - start < dur) anim = requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        }
        anim = requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.classList.remove('active');
        monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        priceOneSub.textContent = monthlyState.oneSub; priceTwoSub.textContent = monthlyState.twoSub;
        animateNumbers({one:monthlyState.one,two:monthlyState.two});
      });
      packageBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        packageBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active');
        packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        priceOneSub.textContent = packageState.oneSub; priceTwoSub.textContent = packageState.twoSub;
        animateNumbers({one:packageState.one,two:packageState.two});
      });

      // initialize monthly
      priceOneSub.textContent = monthlyState.oneSub; priceTwoSub.textContent = monthlyState.twoSub;
      animateNumbers({one:monthlyState.one,two:monthlyState.two});

      // Mood-to-Method logic
      const moods = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
      const methodTitle = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
      const methodDesc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
      const methodSelect = document.getElementById('methodSelect');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
      const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');

      const map = {
        intensive: {
          title: 'Intensive Focus Package',
          desc: 'A concentrated short series (typically 4–6 sessions) to address what feels most urgent. Useful when you need clearer footing quickly.',
          cta: 'Request an Intensive',
          hint: 'Recommended: 4–6 sessions. Availability may vary.'
        },
        short_focus: {
          title: 'Short Focus Work',
          desc: 'Three sessions with a clear target — a manageable window for focused clarity or change-oriented tasks.',
          cta: 'Request a Short Focus',
          hint: 'A compact, problem-focused option.'
        },
        weekly: {
          title: 'Weekly Sessions',
          desc: 'Regular weekly sessions to build steady support and notice patterns over time.',
          cta: 'Schedule Weekly',
          hint: 'Ongoing weekly rhythm for sustained change.'
        },
        transition: {
          title: 'Transition Planning',
          desc: 'A tailored plan to help you navigate life changes with practical steps and reflective work.',
          cta: 'Plan a Transition',
          hint: 'Often 6–10 sessions depending on the scope.'
        },
        maintenance: {
          title: 'Check-in Sessions',
          desc: 'Periodic check-ins to monitor progress or steady a new routine. Shorter and flexible sessions.',
          cta: 'Book a Check-in',
          hint: 'Good for maintenance between more intensive phases.'
        }
      };

      moods.forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
          moods.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
          btn.classList.add('active');
          const key = btn.getAttribute('data-method');
          const item = map[key];
          if(item){
            // subtle morph: fade out, change, fade in
            methodTitle.style.opacity = 0; methodDesc.style.opacity = 0; primaryCta.style.opacity = 0; methodSelect.style.opacity = 0;
            setTimeout(()=>{
              methodTitle.textContent = item.title;
              methodDesc.textContent = item.desc + ' ' + item.hint;
              methodSelect.value = item.title;
              // Update CTA text and ensure link includes a query param for method
              primaryCta.textContent = item.cta;
              // Append a query param to action URL (does not persist across submissions beyond browser behavior)
              contactForm.action = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?recommended=' + encodeURIComponent(item.title);
              methodTitle.style.opacity = 1; methodDesc.style.opacity = 1; primaryCta.style.opacity = 1; methodSelect.style.opacity = 1;
            },220);
          }
        });
      });

      // Prefill the CTA label if template placeholder is set
      // (the primaryCta button uses {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} by default; JS will overwrite when mood selected)

      // Accessibility: allow keyboard selection for moods
      moods.forEach(m=>{ m.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); m.click(); } }) });

      // Progressive enhancement: if JS disabled, the form still submits to PRIMARY_CTA_URL

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for private_practice_therapist-MORE-2026-02-17T07-17-22-854Z-023

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — the contact/booking page with interactive utilities.

What this page includes:
- Header navigation with links to all site pages (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html, contact.html).
- Hero area with a "Mood-to-Method" selector: select how you are feeling and the page will suggest a tailored approach. The suggested method updates the descriptive copy, pre-fills a read-only field in the contact form, and updates the primary CTA label and the form action to include the chosen method as a query parameter.
- Pricing Comparator: a two-button toggle (Monthly vs Package). When toggled the numeric prices animate smoothly between the two sets of values (animated via requestAnimationFrame for a pleasing, lightweight effect). The comparator is intentionally framed as two different program models (Renewal Sessions / monthly membership vs Intensive Focus Package) to avoid reuse of prior naming.
- Contact form collects name, email, phone, a brief message, and the recommended method. The form submits to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Primary CTA text is {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} by default and will update when a mood is selected.
- Confidentiality, scope boundaries, and crisis note included. No guarantees or medical claims are made.

Developer notes:
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for a repeating background pattern. Ensure that unique SVG is added to that path in the assets for visual continuity.
- Placeholders used in the template that must be replaced by the site engine or build step:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}
- The interactive behavior is implemented in plain JS within contact.html. It is unobtrusive: if JS is disabled the form still posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} and the pricing defaults to the initial monthly values shown.
- Accessibility: moods are buttons and support keyboard activation; pricing toggle uses buttons with aria-selected updates.

How to test locally:
1. Place this file in your project root (or appropriate pages folder).
2. Add an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg — the HTML expects it at that path.
3. Open contact.html in a modern browser. Clicking moods updates the recommendation and CTA; toggling the pricing buttons animates numbers.
4. Inspect the form action to verify the recommended method query parameter appears after selecting a mood.

Design decisions and constraints:
- Voice is calm and clinician-forward; copy avoids promises and medical claims and includes clear crisis guidance.
- Pricing labels intentionally avoid prior exact phrases; program names are presented as distinct options.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are referenced.

If you need the accompanying SVG pattern, other site pages, or server-side wiring for placeholder substitution, request the next chunk and I will provide them."}
